  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNOCHA, non food humanitarian needs UNOCHA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ethiopian Humanitarian Fund is an UN-OCHA managed multi-donor fund, which provides grants to UN agencies and NGOs for the delivery of immediate life-saving humanitarian assistance, to communities in need across Ethiopia. The objectives of the EHF include; 1/ ensuring adequate, timely, flexible, and effective humanitarian financing through the government led annual Humanitarian Response Programme, 2/ supporting a cluster based approach to meeting humanitarian needs and 3/ improving the partnership between the UN and non UN actors.</narrative>
  </description>
